    "A reliable-push request must be bound to one trusted gateway, tenant, device, delivery digest and target adapter.",
    "Provider acceptance is valid only when signed by the configured trusted provider and bound to the request adapter, tenant, device, delivery and deduplication key.",
    "Persistent push-outbox state must be signed; an unkeyed digest alone is not accepted as adversarial tamper evidence.",
    "Revocation invalidates active device sessions and queued delivery authority; device replacement requires registrar-signed old revocation and new enrollment bound to the same tenant and user.",
    "Local transport fault-injection evidence cannot promote G3 or production.",
    "A V33.5 adapter endpoint and webhook receiver must be loopback-only, credential-free and redirect-disabled until an external qualification environment is explicitly approved.",
    "Provider receipts and webhooks must be signed, adapter-bound, tenant-bound, delivery-bound and replay-safe.",
    "Local HTTP round-trip evidence is stronger than process-local simulation but is not APNs, FCM, real-device or human UX evidence.",
    "Mobile approval presentation may expose only the scopes and options already bound to the canonical approval card.",
    "A mutually authenticated TLS certificate identifies a registered controller transport but never replaces a signed authority command.",
    "Credential rotation and revocation must be visible to a running authority daemon without restart and must not reduce an existing fence token.",
    "A local process supervisor receipt is research evidence only and cannot qualify systemd or external service management.",
    "A local SQLite WAL authority is research evidence only and cannot be presented as PostgreSQL, etcd, Consul or consensus qualification.",
    "An enterprise workload URI in a locally issued certificate identifies transport identity only; signed application authority remains mandatory.",
    "A separate witness database on the same host may detect rollback but does not qualify an external witness or multi-host durability.",
    "Supervisord restart evidence is local service-manager evidence and cannot qualify systemd or external production operations.",
    "Single-host or synthetic evidence cannot satisfy the V33.20 external qualification challenge.",
    "External evidence intake must bind a signed short-lived session to one challenge, operator role and bundle and may not expand operator authority.",
    "Automatic extraction of untrusted archives is forbidden; exact manifest paths and bytes must be verified before quarantine admission.",
    "Built-in deterministic scanning does not replace external malware qualification; missing external scanning remains fail closed.",
    "Offline evidence verification requires a separately distributed pinned trust policy; keys contained only inside the evidence package are not trust anchors.",
    "Synthetic or loopback-local evidence can prove contract behavior but cannot qualify external trust or production promotion.",
    "Signature feed updates must be signed, fresh, sequence-monotonic, previous-digest linked and preserve pinned critical rules; a separate witness rejects rollback.",
    "Scanner federation uses fail-closed quarantine for any engine disagreement; majority voting and local-reference promotion are forbidden.",
    "External scanner receipts must bind exact supporting artifact bytes; digest-only or boolean-only assertions are insufficient.",
    "Transparency qualification requires signed checkpoints plus inclusion and prefix-consistency proofs; checkpoint substitution or tree rollback fails closed.",
